---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Two listeners for the Todo service: public :8080 and debug 127.0.0.1:6060, versus one shared mux.
const W = 900;
const H = 350;
---
<figure class="gp18b">
  <div class="gp18b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: clients reach the public server on port 8080, which serves only the Todo routes, so a request for /debug/pprof/ gets 404. An operator on the host reaches a separate debug server on 127.0.0.1 port 6060 that serves the pprof and fgprof handlers. Bottom, in red: a single server on port 8080 that serves both the Todo routes and the pprof handlers, so anyone who can reach port 8080 can start a profile.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two listeners: the profiler never touches the public port</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai listener: profiler không bao giờ chạm vào cổng public</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="40" width="860" height="140" rx="8" class="good" />

    <rect x="40" y="56" width="180" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="users" x={62} y={78} size={26} />
    <text x="86" y="83" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Clients</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Client</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="220" x2="252" y1="78" y2="78" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="260,78 251,73 251,83" class="ah" />
    <rect x="262" y="56" width="400" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={640} y={78} size={26} />
    <text x="276" y="83" class="body">:8080 · /healthz  /todos  /todos/{'{'}id{'}'}  /report</text>
    <text x="680" y="83" class="m num">GET /debug/pprof/ → 404</text>

    <rect x="40" y="116" width="180" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="terminal" x={62} y={138} size={26} />
    <text x="86" y="143" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>You, on the host</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn, trên máy chủ</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="220" x2="252" y1="138" y2="138" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="260,138 251,133 251,143" class="ah" />
    <rect x="262" y="116" width="400" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="lock" x={640} y={138} size={26} />
    <text x="276" y="143" class="body">127.0.0.1:6060 · /debug/pprof/  /debug/fgprof</text>
    <text x="680" y="143" class="m num">GET /debug/pprof/ → 200</text>

    <rect x="20" y="196" width="860" height="134" rx="8" class="bad fm-glow" />
    <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={54} y={217} size={26} />
    <text x="76" y="222" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Avoid: one mux serves both</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tránh: một mux phục vụ cả hai</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="40" y="240" width="180" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="users" x={62} y={262} size={26} />
    <text x="86" y="267" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Anyone</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bất kỳ ai</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="220" x2="252" y1="262" y2="262" class="ln fm-flow" />
    <polygon points="260,262 251,257 251,267" class="ah" />
    <rect x="262" y="240" width="400" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={640} y={262} size={26} />
    <text x="276" y="267" class="body">:8080 · /todos  …  /debug/pprof/  /debug/fgprof</text>
    <text x="40" y="312" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Whoever can reach :8080 can ask for a 30-second CPU profile.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ai chạm được :8080 cũng xin được một CPU profile 30 giây.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The 404 and 200 are the real responses from the Todo service run for this post (the commands are in the section). Port 6060 is bound to 127.0.0.1, so only code on the same host, or a port-forward you open on purpose, can reach it.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mã 404 và 200 là phản hồi thật từ Todo service chạy cho bài này (lệnh nằm trong phần bên dưới). Cổng 6060 gắn vào 127.0.0.1, nên chỉ chương trình trên cùng máy, hoặc port-forward bạn tự mở, mới chạm tới được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp18b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp18b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp18b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .gp18b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18b .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp18b .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp18b .body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18b .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp18b .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gp18b .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp18b .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp18b .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp18b .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp18b .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp18b .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp18b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
